{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The captain. And the skilled craftsman.</b> He is the artisan." "<b>And the expert whisperer.</b> Even one who understands how to whisper to snakes, and some say from the root מתלחשים (those who whisper) (Exodus 7:11, 7:12)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra's citation reads שמות ב' י\"ב י\"ט, which would expand to Exodus 2:12 and 2:19, but the context of whisperers/magicians points to Exodus 7:11–12; the citation as written is unclear and rendered as-is."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:38.988613612Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}